matte white plastic and the sleek grey base. The background is softly blurred with a natural depth of field. The camera slowly pushes in on the product. A low, ambient synthesized bass drone is heard, accompanied by a clear, confident Chinese voiceover: \"石头扫地机器人，把家务交给它，享受真正的解放双手。\" [Shot 2] At 03.000, the camera executes a clean macro zoom onto the front sensor module and the \"roborock\" logo. The details are perfectly in focus. The camera focuses sharply on the AI camera and the smooth matte surface, revealing dry and realistic textures without any glossy or oily reflections. A subtle, clear light catches the edge of the sensor without causing glare. The voiceover continues: \"Reactive AI智能避障，精准识别，清洁不留死角。\" [Shot 3] At 06.000, the camera cuts to an extreme close-up of the robot docking into the station. The camera trucks quickly along the curved profile of the base, showcasing the seamless and high-tech integration. The surfaces look solid, dry, and realistic, with a tactile matte finish. A crisp, electronic 'beep' sound is heard as the robot successfully docks. The voiceover continues: \"自动集尘回洗，彻底告别手洗拖布的烦恼。\" [Shot 4] At 09.000, the camera cuts to a medium-wide shot, the robot stays quietly in its station. The camera zooms in quickly with a sudden burst of speed. A bright, clean flash of light briefly glints off the \"roborock\" logo, highlighting the premium smart home aesthetic. The voiceover concludes: \"即刻入手，开启你的智慧家居新生活。\"\n\noverall_soundscape: The soundscape begins with a continuous, low-frequency synthesized bass drone that establishes a sophisticated, modern atmosphere. Subtle, amplified sounds of the robot vacuum running and quiet suction are clearly heard in the foreground, emphasizing precision engineering. As the camera transitions to the macro shot of the logo, a sharp, high-frequency digital chime cuts through the mix, synchronized with the light glinting off the surface. During the docking close-up, a crisp, electronic 'beep' is distinctly audible. Toward the end of the clip, as the camera settles on the station, a vibrant, energetic synth swell dominates the foreground, transitioning into a final, clean, resonant sub-bass impact that lingers as the video ends. A faint, rhythmic electronic pulse plays consistently in the background throughout the entire sequence, tying the dynamic cuts together.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: An elegant, fast-paced modern electronic track drives the sequence, blending ethereal synth pads with a heavy, deep house bassline and rapid, syncopated hi-hat trills. The music maintains a high-energy, rhythmic pulse that perfectly matches the dynamic, multi-shot smart home commercial edit and the sophisticated, high-tech aesthetic of the Roborock product."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "⚙️ CR Prompt Text-提示词：", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [20], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "size": [270, 70], "pos": [-1002.2071533203125, 459.4667663574219], "widgets_values": [12], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "时长：秒", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [21], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [22], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [270, 170], "pos": [-17.27224349975586, 824.3289794921875], "widgets_values": ["9:16 (Portrait Widescreen)", 0.8, 32], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "preview", "la